# Customer lead exports — real names, phones, emails and addresses. These land in
# the repo root because that's where a browser download goes, and one `git add -A`
# would put a customer's whole book into public history permanently.
# Covers this app's own export filename (slug-leads-YYYY-MM-DD.csv) too.
*-leads-export-*.csv
*-leads-[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9].csv

